                                              "fontWeight": "900",
                                              "letterSpacing": 0.25
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "type": "text",
                                              "id": "PXsvv",
                                              "name": "Your work will span the whole stack, fro",
                                              "context": "span",
                                              "fill": "#000000",
                                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                              "width": 572.38,
                                              "content": " Your work will span the whole stack, from front-end architecture to APIs, services, data, and cloud systems, turning complex customer and business needs into thoughtful solutions. You’ll partner closely with Product, Design, Data Science, and SRE. This is a senior individual contributor role with no direct reports. Your influence will come from technical judgment, hands-on execution, and making the entire engineering organization more effective.",
