                                                                                  "gap": 8,
                                                                                  "children": [
                                                                                    {
                                                                                      "type": "text",
                                                                                      "id": "T2qEl",
                                                                                      "name": "• Led the UI team and consulted on front",
                                                                                      "context": "span",
                                                                                      "fill": "#000000",
                                                                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                                                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                                                                      "height": 48,
                                                                                      "content": "• Led the UI team and consulted on front-end architecture for the e-commerce department of a $2B IT solutions provider, owning Zones Connect, a self-service portal where 10,000+ business customers manage their accounts and procurement workflows supporting $4.5M in annual contract value.",
                                                                                      "lineHeight": 1.23,
                                                                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                                                                      "fontSize": 13,
                                                                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                                                                    },
                                                                                    {
                                                                                      "type": "text",
                                                                                      "id": "d4voK6",
                                                                                      "name": "• Led a team of 3 engineers migrating a ",
                                                                                      "context": "span",
                                                                                      "fill": "#000000",
                                                                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                                                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                                                                      "height": 32,
                                                                                      "content": "• Led a team of 3 engineers migrating a legacy jQuery/server-rendered front end to a React and Vue architecture inside a Java web application, reducing page load times by 30% and enabling faster feature delivery.",
                                                                                      "lineHeight": 1.23,
                                                                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                                                                      "fontSize": 13,
                                                                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                                                                    },
                                                                                    {
                                                                                      "type": "text",
                                                                                      "id": "T8mO2c",
                                                                                      "name": "• Owned the mobile-friendly redesign of ",
                                                                                      "context": "span",
                                                                                      "fill": "#000000",
                                                                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                                                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                                                                      "height": 32,
                                                                                      "content": "• Owned the mobile-friendly redesign of zones.com, and built showcase applications demonstrating the Zones API subscription using Node.js, React, and Azure Active Directory.",
